    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n***To bid on this property, please register on mysherryfitz.ie*** \n\nSherry FitzGerald Brady O'Flaherty are pleased to introduce 1 Dillons Row, Maynooth to the market. Occupying a fantastic location, Dillons Row is a mature and well-respected development in a superb town centre position in the heart of this bustling university town.\n\nThis substantial 'A-rated' 6-bedroom end-of-terrace home offers a rare opportunity to acquire a property of impressive scale and flexibility, which has been extensively upgraded and extended to a very high standard in recent years. Ideally positioned close to all amenities, this home will appeal to a wide range of buyers seeking space, versatility and energy efficiency.\n\nMaynooth boasts an enviable range of amenities including excellent transport to the city, University Campus, myriad of shopping, schools, pubs & trendy eateries. The nearby magnificent Carton Avenue also provides a superb amenity for all the family to enjoy and leads one into the expansive grounds of Carton House & Demesne. \n\nExtending to a generous approx. 146 sqm (1,570 sq.ft), this property is impeccably well presented throughout, offering ample bedroom and living spaces. Accommodation includes; welcoming hallway, living room, expansive open plan living / kitchen / dining room, downstairs ensuite bedroom, while on the first floor there 5 fine sized bedrooms, shower room & main bathroom. \n\nAmple, paved off street parking to front and lovely private, low maintenance enclosed rear garden.\nAll in all, a most wonderfully located, energy efficient home in the heart of this expanding university town."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.88m x 1.73m\nWith timber flooring. Guest WC off same.\n\nLiving Room - 5.16m x 3.14m\nWith feature fireplace and timber flooring.\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 5.86m x 8.11m\nExpansive open plan room, with a modern contemporary shaker style fitted kitchen. Amole wall & floor units. Appliances included in sale. Timber flooring & recessed lighting.\n\nShower Room - 1.48m x 2.37m\nWith shower enclosure, WC & WHB. Fully tiled\n\nGuest WC - 1.80m x 0.78m\n\n\nBedroom 6/Study - 3.58m x 2.37m\nWith timber flooring. Ensuite with shower enclosure, WC & WHB. Fully tiled\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.26m x 3.14m\nWith extensive fitted wardrobes & timber flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.69m x 3.14m\nWith extensive fitted wardrobes & timber flooring\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.47m x 1.86m\nWith timber flooring\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.49m x 2.35m\nWith timber flooring\n\nBedroom 5 - 4.60m x 4.32m\nLarge 'L' shaped double room with timber flooring.\n\nOutside - \n• Paved off street parking to front for 2/ 3 cars • Low maintenance paved rear garden • Original cut stone rear boundary wall. • Outside lighting & tap\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Superb town centre location </li><li> All amenities on your doorstep </li><li> Well appointed, energy efficient 'A' rated property</li><li> Extensively upgraded throughout </li><li> Attractively extended </li><li> New composite front door </li><li> Timber flooring throughout </li><li> Air to water heat pump </li><li> Attractive brick front elevation </li><li> Lovely private rear garden </li><li> Quality sanitary ware & tiling. </li><li> Blinds, flooring & appliances included in sale</ul>"
      },
